1
00:01:28,005 --> 00:01:33,844
MAY THE BEST ROACH WIN

2
00:01:36,514 --> 00:01:38,315
Take a look at this.

3
00:01:38,682 --> 00:01:41,051
The results of your annual health checkup?

4
00:01:41,252 --> 00:01:43,020
What's the matter with them?

5
00:01:43,220 --> 00:01:44,889
Your blood sugar's a bit high.

6
00:01:45,089 --> 00:01:47,191
You should watch out for diabetes.

7
00:01:47,391 --> 00:01:49,260
Never mind that. Look here.

8
00:01:49,827 --> 00:01:52,263
"You have the health of a 35-year-old."

9
00:01:52,496 --> 00:01:55,266
I'm as fit as a 35 year old!

10
00:01:55,633 --> 00:01:56,400
Wow!

11
00:01:56,634 --> 00:01:59,837
That's quite young. What's your secret?

12
00:02:01,405 --> 00:02:07,278
I've been going to an aerobics club for about three months now.

13
00:02:07,511 --> 00:02:09,013
An aerobics club?

14
00:02:09,213 --> 00:02:13,584
Yeah. I started going on a friend's recommendation. It's really effective.

15
00:02:13,818 --> 00:02:15,920
Can't let them youngsters outdo me!

16
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,189
Or Ryotsu, for that matter.

17
00:02:18,389 --> 00:02:21,425
Now that you mention it, you have been glowing lately.

18
00:02:21,659 --> 00:02:24,228
Yep! And my shoulders aren't as stiff anymore.

19
00:02:24,428 --> 00:02:26,430
How about you, Terai? Wanna tag along?

20
00:02:27,064 --> 00:02:31,435
Well, I'm not very athletic. I'd just tire myself out.

21
00:02:32,002 --> 00:02:33,671
No need to worry about that.

22
00:02:33,871 --> 00:02:36,440
They use a computer to check your fitness levels,

23
00:02:36,674 --> 00:02:39,944
and then they get you started with a program that suits you.

24
00:02:40,144 --> 00:02:42,446
It's really well thought out.

25
00:02:45,950 --> 00:02:48,219
Oh, Chief. Good morning.

26
00:02:48,752 --> 00:02:50,588
What do you mean "good morning?"

27
00:02:50,788 --> 00:02:53,624
Have you still not got your life in order?

28
00:02:53,858 --> 00:02:56,727
You really think you can perform at work like that?

29
00:02:57,294 --> 00:03:01,031
Don't worry about me. I've got plenty of stamina.

30
00:03:01,232 --> 00:03:04,101
I was up for the last two nights making plastic models.

31
00:03:04,301 --> 00:03:07,471
The night before that I cleared two new games.

32
00:03:07,705 --> 00:03:09,707
And the night before was a bender...

33
00:03:10,274 --> 00:03:12,076
You moron!

34
00:03:15,079 --> 00:03:17,715
Even his voice is more booming than usual.

35
00:03:17,915 --> 00:03:19,483
Because of the aerobics?

36
00:03:20,251 --> 00:03:21,585
Aero-bix?

37
00:03:21,785 --> 00:03:24,788
What's an "Aero-bix," Chief?

38
00:03:24,989 --> 00:03:27,057
I've never eaten one of those.

39
00:03:27,258 --> 00:03:30,761
You should train your mind before you work on your body.

40
00:03:30,961 --> 00:03:31,595
What?

41
00:03:31,795 --> 00:03:34,164
It's not a food, Ryotsu.

42
00:03:34,365 --> 00:03:39,770
Aerobics club. It's a place to play sports to build athleticism and stay healthy.

43
00:03:40,304 --> 00:03:42,273
It's all very scientific.

44
00:03:42,473 --> 00:03:47,945
They have the latest fitness machines and computerized physical strength tests.

45
00:03:48,979 --> 00:03:50,848
Oh, I know them. Don't they charge?

46
00:03:51,081 --> 00:03:55,219
How ridiculous. Imagine paying to exercise!

47
00:03:55,452 --> 00:03:57,354
You don't understand, Ryo-chan.

48
00:03:57,554 --> 00:04:01,158
It's just common sense to invest in your own health and beauty.

49
00:04:01,358 --> 00:04:05,529
People in the West assume smokers and the obese can't manage their health,

50
00:04:05,763 --> 00:04:10,367
and therefore couldn't possibly manage important business decisions.

51
00:04:10,568 --> 00:04:11,669
That's right.

52
00:04:12,536 --> 00:04:17,141
You take zero care of yourself, so you of all people should give it a go.

53
00:04:17,641 --> 00:04:20,878
I'm telling you, I don't need it. I'm plenty fit already.

54
00:04:21,312 --> 00:04:26,016
You moron! I'm saying you need to train with a scientifically-based regime.

55
00:04:26,216 --> 00:04:30,721
With all due respect, that's just throwing money down the drain, in my opinion.

56
00:04:30,955 --> 00:04:32,356
What?

57
00:04:32,556 --> 00:04:36,226
Fine. Let's have a competition to see which of us is fitter.

58
00:04:36,860 --> 00:04:39,563
A competition? Please. That's so childish.

59
00:04:39,797 --> 00:04:42,366
What's the matter? Scared you'll lose?

60
00:04:42,566 --> 00:04:44,335
Say whatever you like.

61
00:04:44,535 --> 00:04:47,338
Why waste energy like that anyway?

62
00:04:47,738 --> 00:04:49,173
Totally ridiculous.

63
00:04:50,174 --> 00:04:53,444
You're always so full of hot air.

64
00:04:53,811 --> 00:04:56,814
No need to compete anyway. It's obvious who would win.

65
00:04:57,214 --> 00:04:59,717
All right. I accept your challenge.

66
00:05:00,184 --> 00:05:03,420
Oh, you've changed your mind? Don't be regretting this now.

67
00:05:03,621 --> 00:05:06,023
Because, look at this.

68
00:05:06,223 --> 00:05:09,360
I'm as fit as a 35 year old.

69
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:12,229
However, I will choose the location.

70
00:05:12,429 --> 00:05:16,066
Two o'clock tomorrow at Kameari Athletic Square.

71
00:05:16,266 --> 00:05:17,368
Fine.

72
00:05:19,403 --> 00:05:20,738
Be prepared, Ryotsu.

73
00:05:24,174 --> 00:05:26,276
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?

74
00:05:26,477 --> 00:05:27,945
Something's fishy.

75
00:05:28,178 --> 00:05:30,547
No, no, it's nothing.

76
00:05:30,748 --> 00:05:32,750
Oh, what's this?

77
00:05:34,284 --> 00:05:35,085
Ah!

78
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:38,656
"Kameari Athletic Square Opening Celebration."

79
00:05:38,889 --> 00:05:40,557
"One million yen competition!"

80
00:05:41,291 --> 00:05:42,893
So that's what you're after.

81
00:05:43,093 --> 00:05:45,195
I knew something was strange.

82
00:05:45,396 --> 00:05:46,730
The chief will be angry.

83
00:05:46,930 --> 00:05:50,234
What? There just happened to be an athletic event with a prize.

84
00:06:03,213 --> 00:06:05,449
You guys don't have to take part.

85
00:06:05,649 --> 00:06:09,953
But I want that one million yen too. It'll help with my home loan.

86
00:06:10,821 --> 00:06:12,489
Hey, sorry to keep you waiting.

87
00:06:13,157 --> 00:06:14,525
Oh, you guys came too?

88
00:06:14,758 --> 00:06:17,961
Yeah, we thought we'd join in and bear witness.

89
00:06:18,362 --> 00:06:19,430
I see.

90
00:06:19,897 --> 00:06:22,666
Sure are a lot of people here. Is something going on?

91
00:06:23,834 --> 00:06:25,235
Who knows?

92
00:06:25,936 --> 00:06:27,671
Hey, I know that voice.

93
00:06:28,105 --> 00:06:30,240
It's the Kameari caveman!

94
00:06:30,441 --> 00:06:32,142
What? You're here too?

95
00:06:32,342 --> 00:06:35,679
Just our luck to run into Kankichi Ryotsu here.

96
00:06:35,913 --> 00:06:39,149
Of all the places you could go, why come to where we are?

97
00:06:39,349 --> 00:06:41,552
You've got a lot to say, don't you?

98
00:06:41,785 --> 00:06:44,121
-Hey, Ryo-san. -We knew you'd be here.

99
00:06:44,321 --> 00:06:46,256
The owners of my regular haunts...

100
00:06:46,457 --> 00:06:47,391
Ryo-san...

101
00:06:47,791 --> 00:06:49,259
Hurry up and pay your tabs.

102
00:06:49,693 --> 00:06:52,996
Every time you see me, it's always, "money, money, money."

103
00:06:53,197 --> 00:06:55,332
You think we want to be hounding you?

104
00:06:55,532 --> 00:06:57,401
If you don't like it, just pay up.

105
00:06:57,634 --> 00:07:01,472
Just wait. I'll win the prize money, and then I'll pay you back in full.

106
00:07:01,672 --> 00:07:03,407
Prize money? What prize money?

107
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:06,009
Oh, never mind. It's nothing.

108
00:07:09,546 --> 00:07:13,150
Welcome, everyone, and thank you for coming.

109
00:07:13,350 --> 00:07:17,154
We will now begin the one million yen survival race.

110
00:07:19,490 --> 00:07:20,891
What?

111
00:07:21,425 --> 00:07:23,560
Ryotsu, what's going on here?

112
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,328
Huh?

113
00:07:24,528 --> 00:07:27,131
What could it be? I have no idea.

114
00:07:27,331 --> 00:07:28,866
You used me!

115
00:07:29,066 --> 00:07:31,368
How dare you sully fitness to make money?

116
00:07:31,568 --> 00:07:35,239
Calm down, Chief. We're still competing.

117
00:07:35,606 --> 00:07:38,976
Or do you admit defeat without a fight?

118
00:07:39,776 --> 00:07:41,778
No, I won't lose to you.

119
00:07:42,012 --> 00:07:43,747
Okay, please go inside.

120
00:07:44,348 --> 00:07:47,251
All participants please go inside and get changed.

121
00:07:49,086 --> 00:07:50,254
What is this?

122
00:07:50,454 --> 00:07:51,855
"LOCKER ROOM"

123
00:07:52,055 --> 00:07:53,924
W-What the heck is this?

124
00:07:55,359 --> 00:07:56,727
It's a cockroach suit!

125
00:07:57,161 --> 00:07:59,196
Please come this way.

126
00:07:59,396 --> 00:08:01,732
Why do we have to dress like this?

127
00:08:01,932 --> 00:08:03,734
I don't like it!

128
00:08:25,389 --> 00:08:28,358
-Wow, this is amazing. -It's a huge kitchen.

129
00:08:28,559 --> 00:08:29,827
What is this?

130
00:08:30,060 --> 00:08:32,729
Are we supposed to be real cockroaches?

131
00:08:32,930 --> 00:08:36,800
Welcome to the Cockroach Athletic Arena, the pride of our facility.

132
00:08:37,034 --> 00:08:42,673
You are to overcome various obstacles in this 20:1 scale diorama of a kitchen

133
00:08:42,906 --> 00:08:46,677
in this real-life cockroach experience.

134
00:08:47,211 --> 00:08:50,280
How did they even make this thing?

135
00:08:51,081 --> 00:08:52,849
If you're gonna quit, do it now.

136
00:08:53,083 --> 00:08:55,686
What? Who said I was quitting! Let's race!

137
00:08:56,520 --> 00:09:00,123
The goal is the bean-jam bun in the bread box on top of the fridge.

138
00:09:00,791 --> 00:09:06,763
The first to get to the bun in 30 minutes or less is the winner.

139
00:09:07,297 --> 00:09:10,267
There are three courses, as marked on the floor.

140
00:09:10,667 --> 00:09:15,172
The choice is yours. You may proceed in any way you like.

141
00:09:16,874 --> 00:09:19,943
The shortest route is to go straight ahead.

142
00:09:20,877 --> 00:09:23,547
No, it's too out in the open.

143
00:09:23,780 --> 00:09:25,983
It must be a trap.

144
00:09:28,185 --> 00:09:31,021
-Perhaps the sink above? -Perhaps the sink above?

145
00:09:33,190 --> 00:09:36,460
Well then, I wish you all good luck!

146
00:09:36,660 --> 00:09:38,028
Ready...

147
00:09:41,665 --> 00:09:42,499
Start!

148
00:09:45,736 --> 00:09:47,371
I'm gonna win!

149
00:09:47,571 --> 00:09:49,273
I'm gonna pay off my home loan!

150
00:09:54,911 --> 00:09:57,281
-You're copying me, Ryotsu. -No, you are!

151
00:10:00,851 --> 00:10:03,387
Ryo-chan's roach-like. Let's trust his instincts.

152
00:10:03,587 --> 00:10:04,321
Okay.

153
00:10:07,457 --> 00:10:09,993
Climbing's no easy feat.

154
00:10:10,661 --> 00:10:12,396
Frontal assault!

155
00:10:14,765 --> 00:10:15,899
We're almost there.

156
00:10:19,069 --> 00:10:22,072
There's an electric roach killer device on the floor!

157
00:10:22,306 --> 00:10:25,175
Why's it so realistic?!

158
00:10:26,710 --> 00:10:29,012
There're no electroshocks over here.

159
00:10:35,185 --> 00:10:37,154
It's so dark. I can't see very well.

160
00:10:37,354 --> 00:10:39,256
The floor feels kind of sticky.

161
00:10:40,023 --> 00:10:40,957
Naoko?

162
00:10:41,892 --> 00:10:43,327
Ouch!

163
00:10:44,061 --> 00:10:45,495
What is this?

164
00:10:45,696 --> 00:10:48,632
Oh no, I think it's...

165
00:10:49,700 --> 00:10:51,935
A cockroach trap!

166
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:57,407
It's mayhem down there.

167
00:10:57,607 --> 00:10:59,076
The sink is the right way.

168
00:11:02,980 --> 00:11:04,748
That million yen is mine!

169
00:11:13,890 --> 00:11:14,925
Help me!

170
00:11:15,125 --> 00:11:17,461
Ryo-san, help me!

171
00:11:17,661 --> 00:11:23,066
How's about you clear my models tab and then I save you, huh?

172
00:11:23,266 --> 00:11:24,368
You're despicable!

173
00:11:24,568 --> 00:11:26,636
Oh well. I won't bother then.

174
00:11:26,837 --> 00:11:29,139
Wait! I'll do it. Just please help me!

175
00:11:29,573 --> 00:11:30,774
That's the spirit.

176
00:11:30,974 --> 00:11:32,409
Here you go. Grab my hand.

177
00:11:38,682 --> 00:11:39,750
Too late?

178
00:11:42,552 --> 00:11:44,321
See you later, Ryotsu!

179
00:11:47,024 --> 00:11:48,458
Damn it.

180
00:11:48,658 --> 00:11:52,262
The flames seem to disappear once every minute or so.

181
00:11:52,462 --> 00:11:54,431
We'll run in the next break.

182
00:11:54,631 --> 00:11:55,832
Once every minute?

183
00:11:57,701 --> 00:12:00,170
I don't have time for that!

184
00:12:06,443 --> 00:12:07,878
Ow! Hot! Hot!

185
00:12:08,278 --> 00:12:09,880
I don't believe it...

186
00:12:10,113 --> 00:12:11,515
He's not human.

187
00:12:16,787 --> 00:12:19,489
You're getting on in years. Don't push so hard.

188
00:12:20,490 --> 00:12:21,358
No you don't!

189
00:12:25,128 --> 00:12:26,263
Damn it.

190
00:12:26,997 --> 00:12:30,200
Chief! There's a wanted robber over there!

191
00:12:30,434 --> 00:12:31,201
What?

192
00:12:31,435 --> 00:12:33,470
Where? Where?!

193
00:12:41,178 --> 00:12:43,680
You need more than fitness to get by in this world.

194
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,982
Gotta use your head too!

195
00:12:46,183 --> 00:12:47,684
Ryotsu!

196
00:12:48,085 --> 00:12:49,886
Damn, you're tough. See you later!

197
00:12:50,087 --> 00:12:51,888
Damn you. That was a dirty trick!

198
00:12:57,894 --> 00:12:59,696
Oh, there's a robber over there.

199
00:12:59,896 --> 00:13:03,867
Oh, Chief. You think I'm dumb enough to fall for the same trick I just used?

200
00:13:05,769 --> 00:13:06,937
Look! 10,000 yen!

201
00:13:07,170 --> 00:13:08,472
What? 10,000 yen?

202
00:13:10,307 --> 00:13:12,242
What a simpleton.

203
00:13:15,479 --> 00:13:19,416
Go on, Ryotsu. Use that head of yours to try and get out of that one.

204
00:13:21,318 --> 00:13:24,654
Damn you... I'm not going to lose yet!

205
00:13:27,958 --> 00:13:30,594
I wonder how far Ryo-chan and the others have got?

206
00:13:33,964 --> 00:13:35,899
You think this will stop me?

207
00:13:38,201 --> 00:13:41,738
What? Ryo-chan was in the cockroach trap back there?

208
00:13:42,105 --> 00:13:46,610
Yes. I think you'll find not even Ryotsu can escape from there.

209
00:13:46,810 --> 00:13:49,579
And with him out of the picture, now we can relax.

210
00:13:49,779 --> 00:13:52,415
I got a bit carried away and overdid it before.

211
00:14:13,470 --> 00:14:15,705
Damn these things stuck to me!

212
00:14:16,373 --> 00:14:18,608
Wow! He's made the impossible possible.

213
00:14:18,808 --> 00:14:21,711
He really does have the fortitude of a cockroach.

214
00:14:22,812 --> 00:14:25,148
What a fantastic show of strength.

215
00:14:28,485 --> 00:14:30,787
Sir, they're going faster than we thought.

216
00:14:30,987 --> 00:14:34,658
Many people will finish the race within 30 minutes at this rate.

217
00:14:35,091 --> 00:14:35,859
What?

218
00:14:36,092 --> 00:14:40,163
I told you. What are you going to do about the prize money?

219
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:44,134
The company can't afford to pay anything at the moment.

220
00:14:45,335 --> 00:14:48,638
We have no choice. I didn't think I'd have to use this.

221
00:15:02,752 --> 00:15:03,853
I'm so far behind.

222
00:15:11,895 --> 00:15:13,496
Oh no! Run for it!

223
00:15:25,442 --> 00:15:29,546
How does tear gas come into athleticism?

224
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:33,550
Behold the power of the robot arm!

225
00:15:34,918 --> 00:15:36,786
There's more surprises to come.

226
00:15:38,622 --> 00:15:40,557
This junk is making it hard to swim.

227
00:15:57,807 --> 00:15:59,042
This is no good.

228
00:16:04,247 --> 00:16:06,583
Well, at least all that cutlery is off.

229
00:16:16,393 --> 00:16:17,427
Ryo-chan?

230
00:16:18,828 --> 00:16:20,664
What? You guys are here too?

231
00:16:20,864 --> 00:16:24,367
Yeah. That arm attacked out of nowhere, so we ran in here.

232
00:16:24,734 --> 00:16:26,136
We can't get out.

233
00:16:28,204 --> 00:16:32,842
Damn it, that one million yen! We can't just stand around in here.

234
00:16:33,043 --> 00:16:35,712
-We'll all jump out at the same time. -What?

235
00:16:35,912 --> 00:16:38,381
They're robots. They can't move fast.

236
00:16:38,581 --> 00:16:41,951
One of us will distract it so the others can move on.

237
00:16:42,852 --> 00:16:43,720
Good idea.

238
00:16:46,156 --> 00:16:48,758
Listen, whoever gets hit, no hard feelings, okay?

239
00:16:50,727 --> 00:16:51,728
Now! Go!

240
00:16:52,796 --> 00:16:55,532
While it goes for them...

241
00:16:55,732 --> 00:16:56,866
I knew it.

242
00:16:59,002 --> 00:17:00,637
Hey, you cheated!

243
00:17:01,338 --> 00:17:03,406
Says the cheater himself!

244
00:17:07,777 --> 00:17:09,079
All right, let's go.

245
00:17:10,647 --> 00:17:13,583
Damn it, I'm not going to be the only one who gets hit!

246
00:17:15,452 --> 00:17:16,820
Damn you!

247
00:17:20,090 --> 00:17:21,291
D-Don't come this way!

248
00:17:25,328 --> 00:17:27,297
You're so mean, Ryotsu.

249
00:17:27,997 --> 00:17:30,333
Serves you right. You're no match for me!

250
00:17:32,802 --> 00:17:33,503
Not again!

251
00:17:37,440 --> 00:17:39,776
Well now, can't hit vertically, can you?

252
00:17:39,976 --> 00:17:41,277
Ryotsu!

253
00:17:42,212 --> 00:17:43,813
Chief, you're still in it?

254
00:17:44,013 --> 00:17:45,181
You're dead, Ryotsu.

255
00:17:45,382 --> 00:17:46,282
Oh no I'm not!

256
00:17:48,985 --> 00:17:50,520
"ELIMINATED CONTESTANTS"

257
00:17:50,754 --> 00:17:52,856
Amazing! They're crawling up the wall!

258
00:17:53,056 --> 00:17:55,291
They're just like real cockroaches.

259
00:18:09,539 --> 00:18:12,308
They're dropping like flies. This is going well.

260
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:15,345
-The insecticide! -This is bad!

261
00:18:20,417 --> 00:18:22,152
It can't reach us here.

262
00:18:26,322 --> 00:18:28,825
Quit following me. You're such a copycat.

263
00:18:29,025 --> 00:18:31,361
And you need to stop cheating.

264
00:18:32,529 --> 00:18:33,630
That's not fair!

265
00:18:38,101 --> 00:18:39,736
Ryotsu's finally been beaten?

266
00:18:39,969 --> 00:18:42,338
He was so close.

267
00:18:45,108 --> 00:18:46,676
He came out up there!

268
00:18:46,876 --> 00:18:48,244
That's no ordinary roach!

269
00:18:49,546 --> 00:18:51,748
Not bad, Chief.

270
00:18:59,756 --> 00:19:02,992
Hey, Chief. A present for you.

271
00:19:03,193 --> 00:19:04,360
Enjoy!

272
00:19:15,205 --> 00:19:17,907
That million yen is mine now for sure.

273
00:19:24,614 --> 00:19:26,916
There's nowhere to hide from here on.

274
00:19:32,755 --> 00:19:34,757
I knew it. The goal is well-guarded.

275
00:19:34,958 --> 00:19:36,392
Can't be careless now.

276
00:19:47,403 --> 00:19:50,306
The goal is right there, and the million yen is mine.

277
00:19:50,507 --> 00:19:53,476
Ryotsu!

278
00:19:53,977 --> 00:19:55,178
Chief!

279
00:19:55,411 --> 00:19:57,046
You'll pay for this!

280
00:19:57,247 --> 00:19:59,883
Please, calm down. Speak quietly.

281
00:20:00,083 --> 00:20:00,950
Listen, you...

282
00:20:01,451 --> 00:20:02,652
It'll find us...

283
00:20:03,820 --> 00:20:05,054
It found us!

284
00:20:06,356 --> 00:20:08,958
Damn it... Not when I'm so close to the goal.

285
00:20:12,195 --> 00:20:14,163
Think you can beat me after all this?

286
00:20:16,499 --> 00:20:17,534
Here I go!

287
00:20:19,435 --> 00:20:22,372
Ugh, so gross. Time to shake you off.

288
00:20:28,511 --> 00:20:29,946
Think you can shake me?

289
00:20:30,313 --> 00:20:31,981
And is Chief mincemeat?

290
00:20:32,181 --> 00:20:34,617
Who're you calling mincemeat?

291
00:20:37,153 --> 00:20:38,621
Chief!

292
00:20:38,988 --> 00:20:40,490
I'm not going to lose yet!

293
00:20:45,495 --> 00:20:47,363
One million yen!

294
00:20:50,099 --> 00:20:51,367
Let go of me!

295
00:20:51,568 --> 00:20:54,871
I will not fall! That million yen is mine!

296
00:20:56,839 --> 00:20:59,976
Such tenacity. Let's see how you handle this.

297
00:21:39,515 --> 00:21:42,518
Uh-oh, I'm gonna fall before long if I stay like this.

298
00:21:44,754 --> 00:21:46,222
The goal. Now's my chance!

299
00:21:49,692 --> 00:21:51,561
He's flying! So gross.

300
00:21:55,231 --> 00:21:56,399
Time for some guts.

301
00:22:00,536 --> 00:22:04,240
I did it! The million yen is mine!

302
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,115
"PRIZE MONEY"

303
00:22:12,315 --> 00:22:13,950
It's one million yen!

304
00:22:15,018 --> 00:22:17,320
Didn't I tell you, Chief?

305
00:22:17,553 --> 00:22:21,457
Paying to go to an athletics club is simply money down the drain.

306
00:22:22,558 --> 00:22:24,227
Aren't you going to get changed?

307
00:22:24,427 --> 00:22:27,463
No. I quite like it. I'm taking it as a souvenir.

308
00:22:28,231 --> 00:22:29,966
Sure, be a cockroach for life.

309
00:22:30,733 --> 00:22:32,135
Hey, Ryo-san, you did it!

310
00:22:34,203 --> 00:22:35,138
Congratulations.

311
00:22:35,338 --> 00:22:36,873
I knew you could do it.

312
00:22:37,073 --> 00:22:38,775
And now, as promised...

313
00:22:38,975 --> 00:22:41,244
Oh, look! Celebrities!

314
00:22:43,279 --> 00:22:47,650
Come on, I dare you to take it! I've got more stamina than the lot of you.

315
00:22:47,884 --> 00:22:49,285
-Damn you! -Wait!

316
00:22:51,454 --> 00:22:53,122
My million yen!

317
00:22:54,624 --> 00:22:56,092
Wait!

318
00:22:56,292 --> 00:22:57,126
I got it!

319
00:23:06,969 --> 00:23:08,104
All right.

320
00:23:09,372 --> 00:23:11,941
Hey, wait! That's my million yen!

321
00:23:13,376 --> 00:23:15,344
Hey, look at this!

322
00:23:15,545 --> 00:23:16,779
What is it?

323
00:23:17,113 --> 00:23:18,848
Just look at this.

324
00:23:19,082 --> 00:23:25,254
Multiple eyewitnesses have come forward reporting giant cockroaches as of late.

325
00:23:25,455 --> 00:23:30,860
Now, our camera crew have managed to film one of the creatures.

326
00:23:31,094 --> 00:23:32,361
Cockroaches?

327
00:23:32,562 --> 00:23:35,331
Take a look at this shocking footage.

328
00:23:41,404 --> 00:23:43,306
One million yen...

329
00:23:43,506 --> 00:23:46,209
My one million yen...

330
00:23:48,411 --> 00:23:53,216
Damn it... Where did it go? My one million yen!

331
00:23:53,416 --> 00:23:56,185
TODAY'S DAMAGE REPORT

332
00:23:56,385 --> 00:24:01,758
COCKROACH ATHLETIC ARENA PARTIALLY DESTROYED
